%% Local clinical work vs AI wording model (non-technical)
flowchart TB
  subgraph LOCAL["On our machines — always"]
    N[Read message and fill checklist]
    S[Decide: ask, advise, or escalate]
    E[Find local evidence<br/>search library + red-flag graph]
    P[Safety check]
    A[Study display arms<br/>short / explanation / graph]
  end

  subgraph MODEL["AI wording model — Vertex Gemini<br/>(or optional local wording model)"]
    W1[Phrase the next question]
    W2[Suggest checklist details<br/>code must still approve]
    W3[Draft recommendation text<br/>from evidence it was given]
  end

  N --> S
  S -->|need a question| W1
  S -->|optional detail check| W2
  S -->|ready to advise| E --> W3 --> P
  W1 --> A
  P --> A
